{"kind":"html","caption":"让指针 p 先走链表 A、到末尾后改走 B；指针 q 则先走 B、再改走 A。交换起点后，两条路线的总长度都变为 m+n，长度差被自动抵消，因此它们会在首个公共节点相遇；若没有公共节点，则最终同时到达 null。判断依据是节点是否为同一对象，而不是节点值是否相等。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>相交链表双指针演示</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  main{ max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 10px 10px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  p { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; color: #8d8d8d; }\n  .panel { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; }\n  .panel-title { margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-top: 8px; }\n  .tag { padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 4px; background: #252526; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; font-size: 10px; }\n  .tag.shared { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; color: #fff; }\n  .lists { display: grid; gap: 8px; }\n  .list-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr; gap: 6px; align-items: start; }\n  .list-name { padding-top: 4px; color: #3794ff; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; }\n  .nodes { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }\n  .node { padding: 4px 6px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #252526; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; }\n  .node.shared { border-color: #3794ff; background: #0e639c; }\n  .value { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .identity { margin-top: 2px; font-size: 10px; color: #8d8d8d; }\n  .arrow { color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 12px; }\n  .route-grid { display: grid; gap: 8px; }\n  .route-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 48px 1fr; gap: 6px; }\n  .route-name { padding-top: 4px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .route { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; }\n  .stop { width: 38px; min-height: 48px; padding: 4px 2px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #252526; text-align: center; transition: .25s; }\n  .stop .step-value { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .stop .step-id { margin-top: 2px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; }\n  .stop.active { border-color: #3794ff; background: #0e639c; color: #fff; }\n  .stop.active .step-id { color: #fff; }\n  .status { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border-left: 3px solid #3794ff; background: #252526; font-size: 12px; }\n  .status strong, .mono { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .rule { margin-top: 8px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 6px; }\n  .rule-card { padding: 8px 10px; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; font-size: 12px; }\n  .rule-card b { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #3794ff; font-size: 13px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>示例 1：交换起点，消除长度差</h1>\n  <p>蓝色尾部表示两条链表共享的同一批节点。两个值为 <span class=\"mono\">1</span> 的节点虽然数值相同，但对象标识不同，所以不是交点。</p>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">原始链式结构</div>\n    <div class=\"lists\">\n      <div class=\"list-row\">\n        <div class=\"list-name\">链表 A</div>\n        <div class=\"nodes\">\n          <div class=\"node\"><div class=\"value\">4</div><div class=\"identity\">A0</div></div><span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\n          <div class=\"node\"><div class=\"value\">1</div><div class=\"identity\">A1：独立节点</div></div><span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\n          <div class=\"node shared\"><div class=\"value\">8</div><div class=\"identity\">C0：共享起点</div></div><span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\n          <div class=\"node shared\"><div class=\"value\">4</div><div class=\"identity\">C1</div></div><span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\n          <div class=\"node shared\"><div class=\"value\">5</div><div class=\"identity\">C2</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"list-row\">\n        <div class=\"list-name\">链表 B</div>\n        <div class=\"nodes\">\n          <div class=\"node\"><div class=\"value\">5</div><div class=\"identity\">B0</div></div><span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\n          <div class=\"node\"><div class=\"value\">6</div><div class=\"identity\">B1</div></div><span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\n          <div class=\"node\"><div class=\"value\">1</div><div class=\"identity\">B2：独立节点</div></div><span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\n          <div class=\"node shared\"><div class=\"value\">8</div><div class=\"identity\">C0：同一对象</div></div><span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\n          <div class=\"node shared\"><div class=\"value\">4</div><div class=\"identity\">C1</div></div><span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\n          <div class=\"node shared\"><div class=\"value\">5</div><div class=\"identity\">C2</div></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"legend\"><span class=\"tag\">灰色：各自独有节点</span><span class=\"tag shared\">蓝色：共享节点对象</span></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">双指针同步前进（每格表示一次比较位置）</div>\n    <div class=\"route-grid\">\n      <div class=\"route-row\">\n        <div class=\"route-name\">指针 p<br>A → B</div>\n        <div class=\"route\" id=\"routeP\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"route-row\">\n        <div class=\"route-name\">指针 q<br>B → A</div>\n        <div class=\"route\" id=\"routeQ\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"status\" id=\"status\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-title\">为什么一定能对齐</div>\n    <div class=\"rule\">\n      <div class=\"rule-card\"><b>路径长度相同</b>p 走 A+B，q 走 B+A，总路程都为 <span class=\"mono\">m+n</span>。</div>\n      <div class=\"rule-card\"><b>比较节点身份</b>只有引用同一节点对象才算相交，节点值相等不够。</div>\n      <div class=\"rule-card\"><b>复杂度</b>最多遍历两条链表各两次：时间 <span class=\"mono\">O(m+n)</span>，额外空间 <span class=\"mono\">O(1)</span>。</div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  const p = [\n    ['4','A0'], ['1','A1'], ['8','C0'], ['4','C1'], ['5','C2'],\n    ['5','B0'], ['6','B1'], ['1','B2'], ['8','C0']\n  ];\n  const q = [\n    ['5','B0'], ['6','B1'], ['1','B2'], ['8','C0'], ['4','C1'],\n    ['5','C2'], ['4','A0'], ['1','A1'], ['8','C0']\n  ];\n  const routeP = document.getElementById('routeP');\n  const routeQ = document.getElementById('routeQ');\n  const status = document.getElementById('status');\n\n  function build(route, data) {\n    data.forEach(function (item, index) {\n      const cell = document.createElement('div');\n      cell.className = 'stop';\n      cell.innerHTML = '<div class=\"step-value\">' + item[0] + '</div><div class=\"step-id\">第 ' + index + ' 步 · ' + item[1] + '</div>';\n      route.appendChild(cell);\n    });\n  }\n\n  build(routeP, p);\n  build(routeQ, q);\n  let step = 0;\n\n  function render() {\n    document.querySelectorAll('.stop').forEach(function (cell) { cell.classList.remove('active'); });\n    routeP.children[step].classList.add('active');\n    routeQ.children[step].classList.add('active');\n    const same = p[step][1] === q[step][1];\n    if (same) {\n      status.innerHTML = '第 <strong>' + step + '</strong> 步：p 和 q 都指向 <strong>C0（值 8）</strong>。节点身份相同，找到首个交点并返回该节点。';\n    } else if (step === 2) {\n      status.innerHTML = '第 <strong>2</strong> 步：p 已到值为 <strong>8</strong> 的共享节点，但 q 仍在值为 <strong>1</strong> 的 B2，尚未相遇。';\n    } else if (step === 5) {\n      status.innerHTML = '第 <strong>5</strong> 步：p 走完 A 后切换到 B；q 走完 B 后切换到 A。交换起点开始抵消长度差。';\n    } else {\n      status.innerHTML = '第 <strong>' + step + '</strong> 步：p 位于 <strong>' + p[step][1] + '</strong>，q 位于 <strong>' + q[step][1] + '</strong>。节点身份不同，两者继续同步前进。';\n    }\n    step = (step + 1) % p.length;\n  }\n\n  render();\n  setInterval(render, 1800);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
